OL,3,ATennis star Svitolina says emotional
OL,4,Atoll of Ukraine war led to Monfils
OL,5,Aseparation
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian tennis star Elina Svitolina
OL,8,Fhas announced the end of her marriage
OL,9,Fwith French former tennis player Gael
OL,10,FMonfils, citing the emotional impact of
OL,11,Fthe war in her country.
OL,13,FThe 32-year-old, who is ranked number
OL,14,Fsix in the world, wrote in a heartfelt
OL,15,Fpost on Instagram about the effect the
OL,16,Fconflict and "what the war has done to
OL,17,Fme inside".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
