OL,3,ATennis star Svitolina says emotional
OL,4,Atoll of Ukraine war led to Monfils
OL,5,Aseparation
OL,6,
OL,7,F"This is the most difficult thing I
OL,8,Fhave ever had to share," she wrote,
OL,9,Fsaying "I need to find my way back to
OL,10,Fmyself". Svitolina said she felt she
OL,11,Fcould not do that within her marriage.
OL,13,FShe said her husband Monfils, 40,
OL,14,F"listened" and "respected what I need
OL,15,Fwith a strength and grace I will never
OL,16,Fforget".
